"The Quarkus community is growing and has now https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/graphs/contributors[834 contributors].\n"
"Many many thanks to each and everyone of them."
msgstr "La comunidad Quarkus crece y cuenta ya con link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/graphs/contributors[834 colaboradores] . Muchas gracias a todos y cada uno de ellos."

